WEBVTT

00:41.332 --> 00:42.584
Hey, careful!

00:44.002 --> 00:45.170
Pull it up!

01:14.574 --> 01:15.533
Seriously.

01:15.617 --> 01:16.951
Are they for real?

01:17.452 --> 01:18.661
Man.

01:19.287 --> 01:21.956
Who does he think he is,
ordering me to come here?

01:22.749 --> 01:24.209
Does he know who I am?

01:24.709 --> 01:27.837
Sir, people tend to be overly suspicious
when making the first deal.

01:28.338 --> 01:30.048
We should be suspicious of them too.

01:30.799 --> 01:32.509
- Let's be suspicious too.
- Yes, sir.

01:32.592 --> 01:33.885
Carry more knives.

01:37.722 --> 01:38.640
Sir!

01:38.723 --> 01:39.974
You carry more knives too.

01:40.058 --> 01:41.059
- Knives?
- Yeah.

01:42.143 --> 01:43.228
They want to see you.

01:43.812 --> 01:45.063
How did their faces look?

01:45.939 --> 01:46.940
I couldn't see them.

01:48.149 --> 01:48.983
You couldn't?

01:49.067 --> 01:50.235
No, I couldn't.

01:51.653 --> 01:53.279
Are they fucking ghosts or what?

01:53.780 --> 01:54.656
Damn it.

01:55.865 --> 01:58.034
- Hey, hide those knives well.
- Yes, sir.

01:58.868 --> 02:00.787
- How many have you got? Two?
- Just one.

02:03.331 --> 02:04.666
- This way, sir.
- Okay.

02:09.212 --> 02:10.713
Fucking hell.

02:10.797 --> 02:12.549
I really can't see anything.

02:13.341 --> 02:15.135
Sir, there's a bag over there.

02:15.677 --> 02:16.678
Shit.

02:18.012 --> 02:18.888
Goddamn it.

02:19.514 --> 02:20.348
What's this?

02:22.058 --> 02:24.018
These are US dollars. What's this for?

02:28.398 --> 02:29.315
Wow.

02:30.942 --> 02:32.777
Hey, I heard

02:32.861 --> 02:35.738
you're looking for distribution channels
other than ours.

02:35.822 --> 02:37.448
Why bother doing the work twice?

02:37.532 --> 02:38.658
It's a hassle.

02:39.617 --> 02:41.327
Just leave it all to us.

02:42.036 --> 02:43.872
We'll sort out everything, hassle-free.

02:45.582 --> 02:46.916
You two, pick this up.

02:48.042 --> 02:49.085
Actually…

02:50.753 --> 02:53.006
What exactly are you looking
to put out there?

02:53.506 --> 02:54.340
Huh?

03:08.855 --> 03:11.566
PROBATION OFFICER
SON OF A BITCH

03:11.649 --> 03:14.235
They're fucking relentless. I swear.

03:15.445 --> 03:16.446
What is it now?

03:16.529 --> 03:19.324
This is the supervising officer.
Where are you?

03:19.407 --> 03:21.034
I'm calling to confirm your location.

03:21.117 --> 03:24.662
Cut it out already, you son of a bitch.
Do you wanna fucking die?

03:24.746 --> 03:26.831
Goodness, there's no need for profanity.

03:27.332 --> 03:29.834
I just need to confirm
that you're heading home.

03:29.918 --> 03:31.878
You have 20 minutes until curfew.

03:31.961 --> 03:34.214
Yeah, I am going now!

03:34.297 --> 03:36.341
I am on my way home!

03:36.424 --> 03:38.343
I'm done talking to you, fucker!

03:42.972 --> 03:45.850
Man, this fucking bastard.
He's a fucking nobody.

03:45.934 --> 03:48.937
Does this motherfucker have
a death wish or something?

04:06.162 --> 04:07.747
- That hurts.
- Tell me. Who are you?

04:07.830 --> 04:09.165
I said it hurts! Damn it!

04:11.292 --> 04:13.378
Did you give this person a ride?

04:13.461 --> 04:16.005
This guy? He got out a while back.

04:16.089 --> 04:17.048
Detective Seo!

04:18.508 --> 04:20.468
Jeon Won-seong's ankle monitor and phone.

04:41.155 --> 04:44.409
A police officer should say, "Police!"
before coming in.

04:45.243 --> 04:47.662
And what kind of police officer
carries a hammer?

04:47.745 --> 04:49.330
Don't you have a Taser?

04:52.000 --> 04:53.668
How do you know Jeon Won-seong?

04:54.669 --> 04:57.005
Jeon Won-seong? I don't know who that is.

04:58.589 --> 05:00.842
You came to check a package
at a stranger's house?

05:00.925 --> 05:03.052
I really don't know him.

05:03.845 --> 05:06.806
A courier delivered a package to me
a few days ago.

05:07.724 --> 05:10.768
The box was full of bullets.
All kinds of them.

05:21.654 --> 05:22.655
Just bullets?

05:23.781 --> 05:24.615
What about a gun?

05:24.699 --> 05:26.242
What gun?

05:26.326 --> 05:27.994
Mine only had bullets in it.

05:28.077 --> 05:30.079
So you came here to find the gun?

05:31.247 --> 05:34.334
Why is a police officer
waving around a hammer and…

05:34.417 --> 05:36.002
Tell me the truth. Now.

05:36.085 --> 05:38.671
That's what I'm doing now.

05:39.255 --> 05:41.716
The package I received had some bullets

05:41.799 --> 05:44.010
and an address list.

05:44.093 --> 05:45.219
An address list?

05:45.303 --> 05:49.807
Yeah, a well-organized address list
with names, addresses, and phone numbers.

05:50.558 --> 05:55.229
I got curious and came here,
but once I arrived,

05:55.313 --> 05:56.814
I felt a bit scared.

05:56.898 --> 05:58.441
So I was just hanging around

05:58.524 --> 06:01.402
when the guy who lives here
suddenly rushed out.

06:05.406 --> 06:06.240
Was it this guy?

06:06.741 --> 06:07.950
Yeah, that's him.

06:08.451 --> 06:11.329
He must've been in a hurry.
He didn't even close the door.

06:11.412 --> 06:14.290
So I came in and saw the box,

06:15.375 --> 06:16.709
only to find it empty.

06:23.674 --> 06:24.717
And then

06:25.927 --> 06:26.928
you came in.

06:39.899 --> 06:40.817
Hey, it's me.

06:42.402 --> 06:43.694
Did you find Jeon Won-seong?

06:43.778 --> 06:47.490
I think the bastard left his phone
in the taxi on purpose to trick us.

06:52.745 --> 06:53.579
And the gun?

06:54.705 --> 06:55.748
You didn't find one?

06:55.832 --> 06:57.458
No, there was no gun.

06:57.959 --> 07:00.378
We'll try to find him as soon as possible.

07:00.461 --> 07:02.046
- Stay safe and update me.
- Okay.

07:08.428 --> 07:11.180
Hello, this is Officer Lee Do
from Domyeong Police Station.

07:11.931 --> 07:15.601
Could you check the security footage
in the alley at 45-2 Jeongil-ro?

07:16.185 --> 07:18.604
We've got a report
that Jeon Won-seong left his house.

07:18.688 --> 07:20.189
Please verify this.

07:20.273 --> 07:22.150
"Please verify this."

07:24.819 --> 07:27.280
Yes, we'll check it promptly
and get back to you.

07:27.363 --> 07:28.739
Okay, thank you.

07:50.803 --> 07:51.637
Jeon Won-seong?

07:56.184 --> 07:57.185
He must have a gun, right?

08:10.615 --> 08:11.449
I will

08:12.325 --> 08:13.159
help you.

08:13.951 --> 08:14.785
Don't move.

08:15.703 --> 08:16.662
One.

08:18.873 --> 08:19.790
Stay still.

08:20.917 --> 08:21.751
Two.

08:23.127 --> 08:24.128
Three!

08:32.720 --> 08:33.554
Officer Lee.

08:34.680 --> 08:35.932
We have Jeon's footage.

08:36.015 --> 08:37.600
It looks like he's on the move.

08:37.683 --> 08:38.684
He's on the move?

08:40.269 --> 08:41.979
Please continue tracking him.

09:04.335 --> 09:05.211
You bastard!

09:22.311 --> 09:23.145
I caught him.

09:30.528 --> 09:33.739
Wait, but who's this?
He's not the guy who lives there.

09:40.079 --> 09:41.747
SECURITY CAMERA CONTROL ROOM

09:47.545 --> 09:48.796
Did you find him?

09:48.879 --> 09:49.714
Yes.

09:49.797 --> 09:50.798
Where is he now?

09:51.716 --> 09:56.012
He was spotted 3 km away, in front
of Ssangryong Restaurant, 25 minutes ago.

09:56.095 --> 09:57.763
Can you get over there right away?

09:57.847 --> 10:01.183
Actually, I don't have a way to get there.

10:15.489 --> 10:16.407
Hello, Officer Jang.

10:16.490 --> 10:19.160
I caught a man breaking into
Jeon's home and left him

10:19.243 --> 10:21.662
by the camera at 45-5-gil,
Seopyeong-gu. Get there now.

10:22.288 --> 10:24.248
- I'll head over there now.
- Okay.

10:28.127 --> 10:28.961
Where to now?

10:29.629 --> 10:31.172
- Hello, ma'am.
- Yes?

10:31.255 --> 10:33.299
I'm on the move.
Update me on his movements.

10:33.883 --> 10:36.927
We'll backtrack his movements
from 28 minutes ago

10:37.011 --> 10:38.512
and keep you updated.

10:42.224 --> 10:44.977
All team members,
track Jeon's movements and locate him.

10:45.061 --> 10:47.772
- Man, I'm nervous.
- Understood.

10:47.855 --> 10:49.023
Ten.

10:49.690 --> 10:51.942
Nine. Eight.

10:53.027 --> 10:55.196
Seven. What?

10:56.781 --> 10:58.741
Oh, those? I told you earlier.

10:58.824 --> 11:00.701
The box was full of bullets.

11:00.785 --> 11:01.744
That's the box.

11:02.703 --> 11:04.455
We're all set on our end.

11:04.538 --> 11:06.540
Officer Lee, are you ready?

11:06.624 --> 11:07.875
Yes, I'm ready!

11:10.670 --> 11:11.587
Yes, go ahead.

11:12.338 --> 11:15.466
From now on,
I'll relay Jeon's exact route.

11:18.594 --> 11:19.762
Watch out!

11:21.013 --> 11:23.891
In 200 meters, turn right
in front of Ssangryong Restaurant.

11:24.642 --> 11:25.643
Here we go!

11:26.268 --> 11:27.228
SSANGRYONG RESTAURANT

11:41.409 --> 11:43.411
Jeon was spotted entering Gongwon-ro.

11:43.494 --> 11:44.829
Put it on the main screen.

11:46.330 --> 11:49.333
He turned right onto Gongwon-ro 409-gil,
which is your four o'clock position.

11:49.417 --> 11:51.127
Thirty meters ahead.

11:51.836 --> 11:54.130
- In ten meters, turn right.
- Turning right!

11:58.426 --> 11:59.593
Keep going straight.

12:13.232 --> 12:15.192
His location was confirmed 21 minutes ago.

12:15.693 --> 12:17.111
Now go right at the laundromat.

12:19.155 --> 12:20.030
BOSTON LAUNDROMAT

12:23.075 --> 12:25.578
Jeon Won-seong entered
a blind spot 16 minutes ago.

12:26.662 --> 12:28.748
This road leads to Hojung Intersection.

12:28.831 --> 12:32.418
Search the roads near the intersection.
You should find him quickly.

12:32.501 --> 12:33.711
We'll take a look.

12:36.589 --> 12:37.965
Found him!

12:38.466 --> 12:40.426
He moved to an underpass.

12:43.012 --> 12:43.929
An underpass?

12:44.430 --> 12:47.433
There's no vehicle access.
Finding an alternate route. One moment.

12:47.516 --> 12:49.101
We have no time. Please hurry.

12:49.185 --> 12:50.311
Let's get going!

12:52.605 --> 12:53.856
Turn right!

12:59.278 --> 13:00.821
Please describe his appearance.

13:00.905 --> 13:02.907
Clothing color, features, anything helps.

13:02.990 --> 13:04.283
A coat and an orange hoodie!

13:04.366 --> 13:07.036
Yes, he's wearing a field jacket
and an orange hoodie.

13:07.119 --> 13:08.370
And cargo pants.

13:08.454 --> 13:09.413
Yes, that's correct.

13:09.497 --> 13:11.999
Oh, and he had
what looked like a fishing bag.

13:14.084 --> 13:15.878
Is he carrying a fishing bag?

13:16.796 --> 13:17.838
Yes, something similar.

13:17.922 --> 13:19.715
There's probably a gun inside.

13:19.799 --> 13:21.634
Excuse me? A gun?

13:22.384 --> 13:25.554
Jeon Won-seong exited the underpass
and turned right 17 minutes ago.

13:26.597 --> 13:27.723
Damn!

13:29.183 --> 13:30.142
Can we handle this?

13:30.935 --> 13:31.769
"We"?

13:31.852 --> 13:33.687
Yeah, "we."

13:33.771 --> 13:34.897
We're a team now.

13:34.980 --> 13:36.690
Stop joking around and focus.

13:53.874 --> 13:57.253
For fuck's sake.
What the hell are these blank rounds for?

13:57.753 --> 13:58.963
Are they kidding me?

13:59.839 --> 14:01.298
He's going into Hyeondae Market.

14:01.382 --> 14:02.925
Go straight,

14:03.008 --> 14:05.761
then turn right into Hyeondae Market
at the fruit shop.

14:05.845 --> 14:07.054
Turn right over there.

14:13.227 --> 14:15.479
In front of the convenience store
14 minutes ago.

14:15.563 --> 14:17.398
In front of the pharmacy 13 minutes ago.

14:17.898 --> 14:18.774
Hold on.

14:19.733 --> 14:22.152
There's no CCTV in this area.

14:22.236 --> 14:24.238
I'll check the nearby cameras
and update you.

14:24.321 --> 14:25.614
It's a three-way fork.

14:25.698 --> 14:28.284
Please check around
Dongil-ro 34-gil, 46-gil, and 41-gil.

14:28.367 --> 14:29.201
Understood.

14:32.329 --> 14:33.414
I found Jeon.

14:33.497 --> 14:34.665
Do you see the pharmacy?

14:34.748 --> 14:36.000
- Pharmacy?
- Yes.

14:36.083 --> 14:38.752
He turned right
in front of the pharmacy 12 minutes ago.

14:50.973 --> 14:52.141
Turning right!

14:54.518 --> 14:56.979
Turned left at 92 Bakseok-ro
ten minutes ago.

15:00.816 --> 15:03.068
Turned right at 87 Bakseok-ro
eight minutes ago.

15:06.697 --> 15:08.824
Turned right at 76 Geumseong-ro
six minutes ago.

15:08.908 --> 15:10.409
Bakseok-ro? Geumseong-ro? So complex.

15:10.492 --> 15:11.869
There, Geumseong-ro.

15:17.333 --> 15:19.752
He turned right at 96 Geumseong-ro
five minutes ago.

15:20.586 --> 15:21.962
Huh? No, he turned left.

15:22.046 --> 15:23.797
Stop. That was 96 Geumseong-ro.

15:26.383 --> 15:27.968
Reverse.

15:34.892 --> 15:37.770
After entering Geumseong-ro,
go straight for 500 meters.

15:37.853 --> 15:38.687
GEUMSEONG-RO

15:44.193 --> 15:45.069
Turn right now.

15:47.571 --> 15:48.989
Go straight for 800 meters.

15:58.332 --> 16:01.961
So, where do you think
Jeon Won-seong is going with that gun?

16:02.544 --> 16:05.255
And you? What were you going to do
once you found the gun?

16:05.339 --> 16:08.258
Stop suspecting me.
I'm even driving for you.

16:08.342 --> 16:10.010
After Jeon Won-seong, you're next.

16:10.719 --> 16:12.846
"After Jeon Won-seong, you're next."

16:13.681 --> 16:15.015
MRS. OH

16:15.099 --> 16:16.684
Someone's calling.

16:19.770 --> 16:21.438
Hold on, I have another call.

16:21.522 --> 16:22.356
Okay, sure.

16:23.273 --> 16:24.108
Hello, Mrs. Oh.

16:24.692 --> 16:27.277
I have an urgent matter.
Can I call you back?

16:27.861 --> 16:29.029
Oh, right.

16:29.738 --> 16:32.116
Of course. I'm sorry to interrupt.

16:32.199 --> 16:33.701
Okay, I'll call you back.

16:36.537 --> 16:37.705
I'm back.

16:37.788 --> 16:40.416
Turn left at the three-way fork ahead
and drive up.

16:44.253 --> 16:46.630
In 200 meters,
you'll come to a downhill road.

16:50.718 --> 16:52.636
Jeon walked down to the main street.

16:53.429 --> 16:55.264
- The main street?
- Okay, let's go!

16:57.224 --> 17:00.019
Don't worry.
I'll take you right to Jeon Won-seong.

17:06.984 --> 17:08.736
- You okay?
- Just go. Hurry.

17:13.198 --> 17:15.951
Confirmed four minutes ago.
Three minutes ago.

17:16.035 --> 17:17.453
Two minutes ago.

17:17.536 --> 17:18.746
Just keep going down.

17:19.580 --> 17:20.622
One minute ago.

17:20.706 --> 17:22.124
He's headed to the square.

17:25.961 --> 17:27.755
Ten seconds ago! Turn on live visuals!

17:36.388 --> 17:37.473
It's way too crowded.

17:38.265 --> 17:41.435
Track him on all security footage
within 100 meters of the square exit.

17:41.518 --> 17:43.687
I'll search from the square entrance.

17:43.771 --> 17:44.688
Got it.

17:46.732 --> 17:49.359
There's no sign of Jeon
30 meters west of the square.

17:49.443 --> 17:50.360
Sorry about that.

17:50.444 --> 17:52.404
Have you found anything else?

17:52.488 --> 17:53.822
We're checking now.

17:53.906 --> 17:56.909
Jeon wasn't captured
on the camera at the square's exit.

17:56.992 --> 18:00.287
He wasn't captured
on the camera 50 meters north either.

18:00.370 --> 18:03.123
He's not on the camera
to the south either.

18:03.207 --> 18:04.041
Wait.

18:04.625 --> 18:06.001
This is strange.

18:06.085 --> 18:08.295
He couldn't have vanished
from the live visuals.

18:08.962 --> 18:10.297
Even if we lost him,

18:10.380 --> 18:13.759
he'd have to approach the camera
to get to the square.

18:13.842 --> 18:15.969
We should have a better visual of him.

18:22.142 --> 18:24.853
If you keep ignoring my rights
and suffocating me like this,

18:24.937 --> 18:26.605
I won't take it anymore.

18:32.653 --> 18:35.322
Is he heading toward the police station
by any chance?

18:35.405 --> 18:36.532
The police station?

18:37.991 --> 18:38.826
Found him.

18:38.909 --> 18:39.952
Where is he?

18:40.035 --> 18:41.829
The last place he was seen.

18:42.329 --> 18:45.082
You're right.
He's heading to the police station.

18:47.960 --> 18:48.794
Are we going?

18:51.547 --> 18:58.512
GYEONGIN SEOBU POLICE STATION

18:59.012 --> 19:01.140
There are more people with guns.

19:04.768 --> 19:05.602
Hey, Officer Lee.

19:05.686 --> 19:08.939
Jeon Won-seong seems to be on his way
to the station with a gun.

19:09.523 --> 19:10.357
What?

19:10.440 --> 19:12.192
I'm also heading to the station.

19:12.276 --> 19:14.987
Tighten security at the entrance.
Meet in the parking lot.

19:15.946 --> 19:18.407
Okay. I'll head down to the parking lot.

20:05.746 --> 20:07.289
WOMEN AND JUVENILE AFFAIRS DIVISION

20:07.372 --> 20:09.583
Looks like he's here for revenge.

20:10.209 --> 20:12.336
- Revenge?
- I'm the one who arrested him.

20:14.630 --> 20:16.465
How many in the station can use a gun?

20:16.548 --> 20:20.135
Everyone's out in the field.
There are only a few desk officers here.

20:20.219 --> 20:22.804
Man, Jeon Won-seong is driving me crazy.

20:22.888 --> 20:24.306
I know, right?

20:24.389 --> 20:26.600
Is he trying to ruin our lives, or what?

20:27.100 --> 20:29.019
No word from the detective team yet?

20:29.102 --> 20:31.230
Hey, they would've called
if they caught him.

20:31.939 --> 20:34.316
- Excuse me.
- Yes?

20:37.402 --> 20:38.654
Captain, handcuffs, please.

20:38.737 --> 20:40.614
- What for?
- I'll fill you in later.

20:44.952 --> 20:47.913
Hey, what are you doing? Come on!

20:48.914 --> 20:49.915
Well,

20:51.416 --> 20:53.335
I have something to ask you.

20:55.337 --> 20:57.923
- Hey, that hurts.
- Stay here and keep quiet.

20:59.591 --> 21:00.676
What was that?

21:03.679 --> 21:05.555
Hey, uncuff me! Take me with you!

21:05.639 --> 21:07.015
Take me with you!

21:10.978 --> 21:11.937
What's going on?

21:16.817 --> 21:18.402
"This is the supervising officer."

21:20.070 --> 21:21.405
"Where are you?"

21:22.447 --> 21:23.323
Say it again.

21:24.366 --> 21:27.160
This is the supervising officer.
Where are you?

21:29.037 --> 21:30.289
What was that noise?

21:30.956 --> 21:32.165
That sweet voice.

21:34.167 --> 21:35.002
It was you, huh?

21:56.690 --> 21:58.567
How does it feel, you son of a bitch?

21:59.067 --> 22:01.987
Do you finally understand
how suffocated I felt?

22:02.070 --> 22:02.904
Do you?

22:03.530 --> 22:04.364
Please.

22:04.948 --> 22:06.158
Please spare me.

22:06.241 --> 22:10.329
After squeezing the life out of me,
you should've seen this coming.

22:10.412 --> 22:12.622
I was just doing my job, okay?

22:12.706 --> 22:14.207
You know that too.

22:14.708 --> 22:15.542
Over there.

22:16.585 --> 22:18.211
That's my job, right?

22:20.297 --> 22:23.425
So why did you work so hard
just to cause this disaster?

22:23.508 --> 22:25.927
- Why?
- I…

22:28.388 --> 22:29.806
I have a five-year-old daughter

22:30.682 --> 22:31.683
and a son.

22:32.434 --> 22:33.518
So, please.

22:34.186 --> 22:35.937
Please have mercy just this once.

22:38.190 --> 22:39.024
You got kids?

22:39.816 --> 22:41.401
What's that got to do with me?

22:46.907 --> 22:49.493
Hey!

22:50.869 --> 22:52.496
What a surprise.

22:53.622 --> 22:56.500
Everyone I'm after
is right here in front of me.

22:56.583 --> 22:58.418
Take it easy and put the gun down.

22:58.502 --> 23:00.837
Hey, Jeon Won-seong. That's enough.

23:00.921 --> 23:03.173
If you keep this up,
things will only escalate!

23:03.256 --> 23:04.591
Put the gun down.

23:04.674 --> 23:06.134
Hey, you fucking morons.

23:07.594 --> 23:10.097
Things have already escalated.

23:11.223 --> 23:12.057
Am I wrong?

23:17.813 --> 23:18.730
Are you okay?

23:19.481 --> 23:20.524
Lights off first.

23:20.607 --> 23:22.150
- Are you okay, sir?
- Yeah. You?

23:22.234 --> 23:23.068
Yeah.

23:36.289 --> 23:38.166
Hey, Do. What do we do?

23:38.667 --> 23:40.627
A single gun might not be enough.

23:41.670 --> 23:44.589
Captain, do you know
where the guns from the gosiwon are?

23:44.673 --> 23:46.091
In the evidence room.

23:46.633 --> 23:48.718
I thought those guns weren't even usable.

23:48.802 --> 23:50.053
There aren't any bullets.

23:52.556 --> 23:53.390
I've got them.

23:54.516 --> 23:56.476
- What's the passcode?
- It's 0920.

23:56.560 --> 23:57.686
Goddamn it!

24:02.649 --> 24:06.111
I'll distract him
while you get these officers to safety.

24:09.239 --> 24:12.784
You're just a bunch of fucking nobodies
pretending to be big shots.

24:28.550 --> 24:29.551
Hey.

24:31.303 --> 24:33.430
You think hiding from me will save you?

24:36.349 --> 24:37.184
Do you?

24:50.447 --> 24:51.448
For fuck's sake!

25:18.642 --> 25:19.476
Damn it!

25:19.559 --> 25:20.894
Fuck!

25:22.896 --> 25:24.439
You fucking bastard!

25:27.484 --> 25:28.610
That motherfucker.

25:32.197 --> 25:33.490
Goddamn it!

25:44.167 --> 25:45.001
Come out.

25:56.221 --> 25:57.347
Run!

26:13.029 --> 26:13.863
Captain!

26:24.374 --> 26:26.543
He's bleeding heavily.
We have to stop it first.

26:27.919 --> 26:28.795
What's going on?

26:29.462 --> 26:30.880
Hey, here!

26:31.464 --> 26:33.008
Uncuff me now, yeah?

26:33.508 --> 26:35.510
I even chauffeured you around.

26:35.594 --> 26:36.845
Uncuff me already.

26:36.928 --> 26:38.722
Come on. Damn it!

26:38.805 --> 26:40.307
I said uncuff me!

26:48.815 --> 26:50.650
- Hand me some gauze.
- Here.

26:53.695 --> 26:55.614
- And the bandages.
- Here.

26:58.116 --> 26:59.743
I'll keep him distracted.

27:01.453 --> 27:02.912
Shoot him as soon as you can.

27:05.290 --> 27:06.583
Okay. Understood.

27:11.796 --> 27:12.631
EVIDENCE ROOM

27:35.945 --> 27:37.822
I have a really bad feeling about this.

27:47.666 --> 27:49.417
Excuse me, is something going on?

28:03.098 --> 28:05.016
GYEONGIN SEOBU POLICE
INSPECTOR SEO

28:06.935 --> 28:07.769
Hello?

28:08.269 --> 28:09.854
Captain, are you all right?

28:09.938 --> 28:11.856
We're almost there.

28:11.940 --> 28:14.359
Don't come straight in when you get here.

28:15.068 --> 28:16.695
Move with the support team.

28:16.778 --> 28:20.198
Do you understand?
Don't come in alone, no matter what.

28:21.157 --> 28:23.076
What are you talking about?

28:43.012 --> 28:44.013
Hey, wait for me.

29:06.202 --> 29:08.121
Come in! All units are isolated.

29:08.204 --> 29:09.330
Retreat, everyone!

29:11.332 --> 29:14.002
We can't identify friend or foe
because of the storm.

29:14.502 --> 29:17.464
Cease operation.
Everyone, retreat immediately.

29:17.547 --> 29:19.299
- Just a moment.
- Over here. Help me.

29:19.382 --> 29:22.719
Lee Do! We must retreat first.
That's an order. Retreat!

29:22.802 --> 29:25.221
We can't. There are still survivors
on the battlefield.

29:25.305 --> 29:28.516
If you stay there, you'll all die.
Retreat now!

29:48.745 --> 29:53.041
You know what?
I was so scared of you fuckers.

29:54.459 --> 29:57.003
I mean, you were acting so freaking tough.

30:06.429 --> 30:08.056
Especially your subordinate.

30:08.556 --> 30:10.809
That huge dumbass.

30:11.518 --> 30:12.769
That fucking asshole.

30:14.062 --> 30:16.689
He turned off the security camera
to beat my ass.

30:21.069 --> 30:24.072
But the moment he saw me holding this gun,

30:24.155 --> 30:26.866
he started shaking like a leaf
and ran away.

30:28.076 --> 30:29.911
In your face, you pathetic ass.

30:31.204 --> 30:32.038
What?

30:34.666 --> 30:36.751
Can't run away with a bullet in you, huh?

30:37.836 --> 30:38.795
Yeah, you're right.

30:40.213 --> 30:41.756
Just like you said…

30:43.883 --> 30:47.011
I have no strength to fight back anymore.

30:47.679 --> 30:48.930
So?

30:49.848 --> 30:50.765
But…

30:54.936 --> 30:59.232
if you really thought I'd beg
a piece of shit like you for my life…

31:01.234 --> 31:03.111
Well, sorry to disappoint.

31:09.409 --> 31:10.660
Wow.

31:10.743 --> 31:12.954
Acting tough until the very end, huh?

31:15.498 --> 31:17.166
Hey, I've got

31:18.167 --> 31:19.711
a question for you.

31:21.421 --> 31:22.422
How many…

31:30.972 --> 31:32.098
kids do you have?

31:32.599 --> 31:35.310
You motherfucker.

31:50.575 --> 31:51.784
You fucking--

31:53.244 --> 31:54.287
What the hell?

31:59.667 --> 32:01.711
Come out now, you sons of bitches!

32:02.629 --> 32:05.882
Stop hiding like little rats!
Come out, you motherfuckers!

33:05.108 --> 33:06.693
Who the fuck just shot me?

33:06.776 --> 33:08.403
Come out, you bastard!

33:09.696 --> 33:10.822
Damn it.

33:17.662 --> 33:20.039
I said come out, you fucker!

33:23.292 --> 33:25.294
Come out!

33:42.812 --> 33:43.813
Shit!

34:01.581 --> 34:03.207
You fucking son of a bitch.

34:04.250 --> 34:06.794
You motherfucker,
how dare you toy with me!

34:07.879 --> 34:11.674
Fine, let's fucking go, you fucker!

34:21.100 --> 34:22.810
You're that pig from earlier, right?

34:23.728 --> 34:24.854
You scared?

34:24.937 --> 34:26.731
I said come out, goddamn it!

34:30.193 --> 34:33.404
Fucking hell.
Why is everyone always out to get me?

34:58.262 --> 34:59.764
Jeon Won-seong, drop the gun.

35:06.521 --> 35:07.730
Fuck off, you bitch!

35:10.566 --> 35:12.985
This is your last warning. Drop the gun.

35:13.069 --> 35:16.572
All right. Fine.

35:16.656 --> 35:18.241
Here it is.

35:18.324 --> 35:19.826
Here's the gun.

35:20.868 --> 35:21.828
Sir, are you okay?

35:24.372 --> 35:25.623
Yes, Captain Joo is okay.

36:26.851 --> 36:28.644
I don't want to hold a gun anymore.

36:30.771 --> 36:32.356
If I have a gun in my hand…

36:37.653 --> 36:39.363
…I feel like I have no choice…

36:41.949 --> 36:44.744
but to take one life
to save another again.

36:46.913 --> 36:49.207
Please drop the gun. Please.

41:15.222 --> 41:20.227
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
